{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Organize dataset tables"},"description":"Save ordered sections, table display titles and descriptions, collapsed sections and a separate default opening table. Read get_my_dataset for dataset_layout and its revision; use expected_revision 0 only when absent. For first creation also send expected_main_table_id from get_my_dataset.chosen_main_table_id (null if absent), to detect concurrent legacy opening-table edits. Choose sections around the dataset use case. Preserve owner choices; on layout_changed reread and reconcile instead of overwriting. Reference exact table IDs, each in at most one section. Unassigned tables stay visible. This changes presentation only, never SQL/API names, data, access or schedules. dry_run validates without saving. Returns the saved layout and revision.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"config":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"default_table_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"sections":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"collapsed":{"type":"boolean"},"id":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$","type":"string"},"tables":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"table_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"title":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["table_id"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":500,"type":"array"},"title":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"type":"s